      "beat_id": "B05",
      "t_start": 42.0,
      "estimated_duration_s": 11.0,
      "act": "THE PROBLEM",
      "narration_text": "The reviewer's rubric existed. The funder always evaluates equity lens and measurable outcomes. Nadia knew this at some level. But she had not written it down — and so it was never in the prompt.",
