    {
      "beat_id": "B07",
      "t_start": 64.0,
      "estimated_duration_s": 11.0,
      "act": "THE MECHANISM",
      "narration_text": "Writing criteria before generating forces you to articulate what success means. That articulation is the information the prompt actually required. The criteria don't just improve the output — they reveal requirements you hadn't consciously stated.",
