      "t_start": 75.0,
      "estimated_duration_s": 9.0,
      "act": "THE MECHANISM",
      "narration_text": "Criteria also give you a review checklist. Instead of reading for general impressiveness — which is how automation bias traps you — you run five specific checks.",
