      "beat_id": "B10",
      "t_start": 96.0,
      "estimated_duration_s": 11.0,
      "act": "THE IMPLICATION",
      "narration_text": "The act of writing criteria before prompting is how you discover what you actually need. Grant writers who write acceptance criteria learn something about what the funder requires. Analysts who write failure criteria learn something about what they won't accept.",
