    {
      "beat_id": "B13",
      "t_start": 132.0,
      "estimated_duration_s": 11.0,
      "act": "THE PRACTICE",
      "narration_text": "Before writing any prompt, ask two questions: what does good look like? And what would make this wrong regardless of how polished it is? Write both down. Those answers are the criteria — and the criteria are the actual specification.",
